ob description
Grid Dynamics is seeking a Senior Data Scientist with strong expertise in generative AI to design and deploy end-to-end AI solutions. The role focuses on building RAG-based chatbots, LLM-powered analytics systems, and AI agents using frameworks like LangGraph, along with developing data pipelines using tools such as LlamaIndex.
The candidate should have hands-on experience with vector databases, multiple LLM APIs (OpenAI, Gemini, Claude), and observability tools like LangSmith. A solid background in traditional machine learning (regression, classification, clustering) and proficiency in Python, PyTorch, or TensorFlow is also required.
Additional expectations include experience with MLOps, containerization (Docker/Kubernetes), API development, and prompt engineering. Familiarity with fine-tuning LLMs, deploying open-source models, and cloud platforms is a plus.
